[background arg="res://backgrounds/Town.png" fade="1.0"]

# Reset the reveal so the scene plays correctly on a replay or a reloaded save.
set {elion_name} = "???"

narrator: One fateful day, Remi heard that a nearby festival was holding a dancing contest. #id:df
narrator: The grand prize was 100 gold... and a chance to perform in the capital city. #id:e0
narrator: It was the perfect opportunity for Remi to finally show everyone what he could do. #id:e1
narrator: But there was one problem... the contest only allowed group performances with at least four members. #id:e2
narrator: If Remi wanted to enter, he would need to find some teammates and convince them to join his group. #id:e3
narrator: And so, his search for the perfect dance team began. #id:e4

join remi (Sad) left

remi: Squeak… #id:e5

narrator: Remi searched high and low, looking for anyone who was alone and wouldn't be afraid of him just because he was a rat. #id:e6
narrator: But no matter where he looked, no one seemed to notice the small rat wandering around. #id:e7
narrator: After searching for so long, Remi began to feel tired and discouraged. #id:e8
narrator: Just as he was about to give up, he noticed someone approaching him... #id:e9

join elion (Confused) right

elion: Eh? #id:ea

narrator: The one who found Remi was a tall young elf with long, straight blonde hair. He carried himself like a trained warrior, calm, confident, and composed, yet there was an unmistakable kindness in his eyes. #id:eb
narrator: Unlike everyone else, he did not hesitate or look down on Remi. Instead, he approached with a gentle smile and greeted him in a deep, calm voice. #id:ec

elion: Sir, may I ask why you are lying here on the ground? Are you injured? #id:ed
remi: Squeak... Squeak squeak. #id:ee
elion (Sad): Oh, my lord... So that is what happened. #id:ef
elion: I am sorry you had to go through that, you must have felt terribly alone. #id:f0
remi (Confused): Squeak... Squeak? #id:f1
elion (Surprised): Ah! Forgive me. I have been speaking to you without even introducing myself. #id:f2
remi (Default): Squeak! #id:f3

# He introduces himself here, so the name box stops saying ??? from this point on.
set {elion_name} = "Elion"

elion (Default): [b]Elion Theran[/b], youngest of the Theran family of Silvermoon! #id:f4
elion (Confused): It is an honor to meet you, Sir...? #id:f5
remi (Happy): Squeak! #id:f6
elion (Smile): Remi, is it? A pleasure to meet you, Sir Remi! #id:f7
elion (Default): Now then, Sir Remi. What brought you all the way out here? #id:f8
remi (Please): Squeak... Squeak squeak squeak. #id:f9
elion (Confused): A dancing contest? And you require companions to form a team? #id:fa
elion (Thinking): I see… #id:fb
elion (Smile): Then I shall accompany you! #id:fc
remi (Surprised): Squeak?! #id:fd
elion (Default): Of course. You are searching for help, and I am standing right here. It would be rather strange of me to refuse, would it not? #id:fe
elion (Determined): Besides, as a [b]paladin[/b], lending a hand to those in need is simply the right thing to do! #id:ff
remi (Happy): Squeak! Squeak squeak! #id:100
elion (Confused): Ah, yes! You mentioned that you were a dancer. #id:101
elion (Determined): I must confess, I have never seen a rat dance before. #id:102
elion (Thinking): ...Though I suppose I have never asked one to. #id:103

narrator: For someone who looked so dignified, Elion seemed completely serious. #id:104

elion (Determined): Now you have made me curious, Sir Remi. #id:105
elion (Smile): Before we set off, would you honor me with a performance? #id:106
remi (Happy): Squeak! #id:107

narrator: Remi quickly jumped back onto his feet. After searching all day, he had finally found someone willing to believe in him. #id:108

elion (Default): The stage is yours, Sir Remi! #id:109

narrator: And so, with his very first companion watching, Remi's first performance began… #id:10a